  <p id="c-jinshu-050-jin044-zhengmo:family" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-050-jin044-zhengmo:family:m0000" ref="p6s_2qn_p8n_A">曹志</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-050-jin044-zhengmo:family:m0004" ref="p6s_2qn_p8n_A">允恭</persName>，譙國譙人，<persName id="c-jinshu-050-jin044-zhengmo:family:m0012" ref="p6s_2qn_p8n">魏陳思王植</persName>之孽子也。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-050-jin044-zhengmo:office" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">太常<persName id="c-jinshu-050-jin044-zhengmo:office:m0002" ref="x18_cng_88g">鄭默</persName>、博士祭酒<persName id="c-jinshu-050-jin044-zhengmo:office:m0009" ref="p6s_2qn_p8n_A">曹志</persName>並過其事。</p>
